{
  "format": 0,
  "id": "paccard-222-rosette",
  "title": "Large rosette of a Moroccan panel (Paccard, page 222)",
  "short": "Paccard rosette",
  "subtitle": "Morocco, after Paccard, page 222 top left",
  "given": {
    "O": "The centre of the small star in the middle of the large rosette.",
    "A": "A point of that small star."
  },
  "fold": 4,
  "star": 8,
  "style": "Moroccan",
  "level": "advanced",
  "construction": {
    "basis": "reconstruction",
    "fidelity": "not-applicable",
    "note": "The finished design was read from Wichmann’s P18B drawing. Its tile corners were snapped to the square-root-of-two grid with the small star’s point radius as the unit. Every line, in all four directions, lies at one of twelve distances from O, so each is drawn once as a vertical line and turned round O; three diagonals near the corner of the tile complete the corner rosette. The drawing gives no steps; we devised the construction.",
    "changes": "The compass steps, their order and the named points are ours. The tile edges follow the plain drawing; its thin strokes over the joints are not bands. The colours follow Wichmann’s drawing, mapped to the Marinid zellige palette. His drawing of the bottom-left panel of the same page (P18A) changes the large rosette and shares the rest. No photograph was checked.",
    "reviewed": "2026-10-26"
  },
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "Tiling Search, data157/P18B: Morocco, after Paccard, page 222 top left",
      "creator": "Brian Wichmann",
      "kind": "drawing",
      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data157/P18B.html",
      "note": "Read from his finished drawing, not construction instructions. His reference is André Paccard, Traditional Islamic Craft in Moroccan Architecture (1980), page 222, which does not name the building."
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Draw a horizontal straight line through O and A. Draw a circle with centre O through A.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through O. It crosses the circle at C and D. The horizontal line crosses the circle at B on the left. Draw a vertical line through A. Draw a horizontal line through C. They cross at E. Draw a straight line through O and E. Draw a line through O at 90° to line OE. The circle crosses the four lines through O at S1 to S8.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "B": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "C": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "D": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "ax": {"line": {"through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "cy": {"line": {"through": "C", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "E": {"point": {"meet": ["ax", "cy"]}},
        "d45": {"line": {"through": ["O", "E"]}},
        "d135": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "S1": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 0.0}}},
        "S2": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "S3": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "S4": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d135"], "pick": {"angle": 135.0}}},
        "S5": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "S6": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 225.0}}},
        "S7": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "S8": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d135"], "pick": {"angle": 315.0}}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Draw the star at O as two squares.",
      "animate": "ruler",
      "parts": [
        {
          "text": "Draw a straight line through S1 and S3, S3 and S5, S5 and S7, and S7 and S1. Draw each line long, beyond the circle.",
          "create": {
            "q01": {"line": {"through": ["S1", "S3"]}},
            "q02": {"line": {"through": ["S3", "S5"]}},
            "q03": {"line": {"through": ["S5", "S7"]}},
            "q04": {"line": {"through": ["S7", "S1"]}}
          },
          "animate": "ruler"
        },
        {
          "text": "Draw a straight line through S2 and S4, S4 and S6, S6 and S8, and S8 and S2. Draw each line long, beyond the circle.",
          "create": {
            "q11": {"line": {"through": ["S2", "S4"]}},
            "q12": {"line": {"through": ["S4", "S6"]}},
            "q13": {"line": {"through": ["S6", "S8"]}},
            "q14": {"line": {"through": ["S8", "S2"]}}
          },
          "animate": "ruler"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The vertical side from S8 to S2 crosses the horizontal line at P. Keep the compass open to OA. Draw circles with centres P and U1 in turn. Each circle crosses the horizontal line to the right at U1 and U2.",
      "create": {
        "P": {"point": {"meet": ["q14", "h"]}},
        "cu1": {"circle": {"centre": "P", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "U1": {"point": {"meet": ["cu1", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 0.0}}},
        "cu2": {"circle": {"centre": "U1", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "U2": {"point": {"meet": ["cu2", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Keep the compass open to OE. Draw circles with centres U2 and U3 in turn. Each circle crosses the horizontal line to the right at U3 and U4. Draw a circle with centre U4 and radius OA. It crosses the horizontal line at U5, to the right. Draw a circle with centre U5 and radius OE. It crosses the horizontal line at U6, to the right.",
      "create": {
        "cu3": {"circle": {"centre": "U2", "radiusFrom": ["O", "E"]}},
        "U3": {"point": {"meet": ["cu3", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cu4": {"circle": {"centre": "U3", "radiusFrom": ["O", "E"]}},
        "U4": {"point": {"meet": ["cu4", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cu5": {"circle": {"centre": "U4", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "U5": {"point": {"meet": ["cu5", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cu6": {"circle": {"centre": "U5", "radiusFrom": ["O", "E"]}},
        "U6": {"point": {"meet": ["cu6", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre U5 and radius OP. It crosses the horizontal line at V, towards O. Draw a circle with centre V through O. It crosses the horizontal line at T1. Draw a circle with centre O through T1. It crosses the horizontal and vertical lines at T2, T3 and T4.",
      "create": {
        "cv": {"circle": {"centre": "U5", "radiusFrom": ["O", "P"]}},
        "V": {"point": {"meet": ["cv", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "ct": {"circle": {"centre": "V", "through": "O"}},
        "T1": {"point": {"meet": ["ct", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "co": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "T1"}},
        "T2": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "T3": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "T4": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through each of T1 and T3. Draw a horizontal line through each of T2 and T4. They make a square with corners K1, K2, K3 and K4.",
      "create": {
        "gx": {"line": {"through": "T1", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "gy": {"line": {"through": "T2", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "gxw": {"line": {"through": "T3", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "gys": {"line": {"through": "T4", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "K1": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gy"]}},
        "K2": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gy"]}},
        "K3": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gys"]}},
        "K4": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gys"]}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Draw five circles with centre T1. Their radii are the distances from O to P, U1, U2, U3 and U4. They cross the horizontal line at W1 to W5, towards O.",
      "create": {
        "cw1": {"circle": {"centre": "T1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "P"]}},
        "W1": {"point": {"meet": ["cw1", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "cw2": {"circle": {"centre": "T1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "U1"]}},
        "W2": {"point": {"meet": ["cw2", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "cw3": {"circle": {"centre": "T1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "U2"]}},
        "W3": {"point": {"meet": ["cw3", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "cw4": {"circle": {"centre": "T1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "U3"]}},
        "W4": {"point": {"meet": ["cw4", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "cw5": {"circle": {"centre": "T1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "U4"]}},
        "W5": {"point": {"meet": ["cw5", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through each of U1 to U6 and W1 to W5. Turn the eleven new lines round O by 45°, seven times.",
      "create": {
        "vU1": {"line": {"through": "U1", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vU2": {"line": {"through": "U2", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vU3": {"line": {"through": "U3", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vU4": {"line": {"through": "U4", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vU5": {"line": {"through": "U5", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vU6": {"line": {"through": "U6", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vW1": {"line": {"through": "W1", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vW2": {"line": {"through": "W2", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vW3": {"line": {"through": "W3", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vW4": {"line": {"through": "W4", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vW5": {"line": {"through": "W5", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vp": {
          "repeat": {
            "of": ["vU1", "vU2", "vU3", "vU4", "vU5", "vU6", "vW1", "vW2", "vW3", "vW4", "vW5"],
            "by": "rot8"
          }
        }
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Draw three circles with centre K1. Their radii are the distances from O to P, U2 and U3. They cross line OE at X1, X2 and X3. Draw a line through each of X1, X2 and X3 at 90° to line OE. Turn the three new lines round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "ck1": {"circle": {"centre": "K1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "P"]}},
        "X1": {"point": {"meet": ["ck1", "d45"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "dx1": {"line": {"through": "X1", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "ck2": {"circle": {"centre": "K1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "U2"]}},
        "X2": {"point": {"meet": ["ck2", "d45"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "dx2": {"line": {"through": "X2", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "ck3": {"circle": {"centre": "K1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "U3"]}},
        "X3": {"point": {"meet": ["ck3", "d45"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "dx3": {"line": {"through": "X3", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "dxp": {"repeat": {"of": ["dx1", "dx2", "dx3"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Join K1, K2, K3 and K4 to mark the tile that repeats.",
      "create": {"tile": {"polygon": ["K1", "K2", "K3", "K4"]}},
      "animate": "fade"
    }
